re the Nova would end and the Machine would start on that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh man! That\u2019s huge! A nova with that would become Q10 before finishing only to gather all the material needed...awesome!<br /> <br /> i was planning to make some psions finding an Dyson Sphere being build around an dwarf star by an group of Novas... but now it is going to be a Matrioshka brain instead...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T04:27:14-08:00","id":1357985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1357904-what-can-quantum-9-novas-make?p=1357955#post1357955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh man! That\u2019s huge! A nova with that would become Q10 before finishing only to gather all the material needed...awesome!<br /> <br /> i was planning to make some psions finding an Dyson Sphere being build around an dwarf star by an group of Novas... but now it is going to be a Matrioshka brain instead...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> One of the hypothetical uses for such a computer would be fully simulating a whole other universe... clearly one needs to prototype one's universe!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T04:48:28-08:00","id":1357988,"title":"","content":"Yeah, and in my own experiments (as part of testing out the system, me and a friend made Novas, did some basic roleplay, then time-shifted years in the future to see what they'd play like at higher scales) like, consider that Growth actually goes up <i>one higher</i> compared to the Nova proper. That is, a Q9 nova with Growth 9 is actually <i>Scale 10</i>, which is Ludicrous Big.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T14:10:38-08:00","id":1358077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1357904-what-can-quantum-9-novas-make?p=1357955#post1357955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh man! That\u2019s huge! A nova with that would become Q10 before finishing only to gather all the material needed...awesome!<br /> <br /> i was planning to make some psions finding an Dyson Sphere being build around an dwarf star by an group of Novas... but now it is going to be a Matrioshka brain instead...</div> </div> </div> </div>Do both. Have the PCs find the Dyson Sphere, explore it some including activating a few &quot;security measure&quot; that make their exploration... interesting. Then have one of the things they find there be plans/coordinates for an even bigger project.<br /> <br /> At the same time, though, consider that the Novas who did this don't have to be human. Earth people are the only ones who can develop Talents, Novas and Psiads/Psions. But a lot of other beings could develop Talents. Or Psi. Or Quantum. So, sure, they find these immense Quantum-built structures - and learn that they're millions if not billions of years old.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}